    "Ask to be shown something — “show me the Colosseum” — and the cat draws it here, on this Mac's GPU, with Stable Diffusion. Nothing is sent anywhere, and it costs nothing but the time." : {
      "comment" : "Ask to be shown something — “show me the Colosseum” — and the cat draws it here, on this Mac's GPU, with Stable Diffusion. Nothing is sent anywhere, and it costs nothing but the time.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask to be shown something — “show me the Colosseum” — and the cat draws it here, on this Mac's GPU, with Stable Diffusion. Nothing is sent anywhere, and it costs nothing but the time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pide ver algo — «enséñame el Coliseo» — y el gato lo dibuja aquí, en la GPU de este Mac, con Stable Diffusion. No se envía nada a ninguna parte, y solo cuesta tiempo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demandez à voir quelque chose — « montre-moi le Colisée » — et le chat le dessine ici, sur le GPU de ce Mac, avec Stable Diffusion. Rien n’est envoyé nulle part, et cela ne coûte que du temps."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chiedi di vedere qualcosa — “mi mostri il Colosseo?” — e il gatto lo disegna qui, sulla GPU di questo Mac, con Stable Diffusion. Non viene inviato niente da nessuna parte, e non costa altro che il tempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asked about today's news or the weather, it can fetch one of a fixed list of two dozen feeds: ANSA (the wire, world, technology, politics, culture, sport, and your own region), la Repubblica, Corriere della Sera, Il Fatto Quotidiano, Il Sole 24 Ore, RaiNews, Tgcom24, AGI, La Gazzetta dello Sport, Wired, DDay, Focus, MeteoAlarm's warnings for Italy, Hacker News, BBC News, The Guardian, The New York Times and NPR. Every one of them was fetched with this application's own name on the request before it went on the list. The plain forecast comes from open-meteo, because neither 3B Meteo nor meteo.it publishes a feed any more." : {
      "comment" : "Asked about today's news or the weather, it can fetch one of a fixed list of two dozen feeds: ANSA (the wire, world, technology, politics, culture, sport, and your own region), la Repubblica, Corriere della Sera, Il Fatto Quotidiano, Il Sole 24 Ore, RaiNews, Tgcom24, AGI, La Gazzetta dello Sport, Wired, DDay, Focus, MeteoAlarm's warnings for Italy, Hacker News, BBC News, The Guardian, The New York Times and NPR. Every one of them was fetched with this application's own name on the request before it went on the list. The plain forecast comes from open-meteo, because neither 3B Meteo nor meteo.it publishes a feed any more.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Asked about today's news or the weather, it can fetch one of a fixed list of two dozen feeds: ANSA (the wire, world, technology, politics, culture, sport, and your own region), la Repubblica, Corriere della Sera, Il Fatto Quotidiano, Il Sole 24 Ore, RaiNews, Tgcom24, AGI, La Gazzetta dello Sport, Wired, DDay, Focus, MeteoAlarm's warnings for Italy, Hacker News, BBC News, The Guardian, The New York Times and NPR. Every one of them was fetched with this application's own name on the request before it went on the list. The plain forecast comes from open-meteo, because neither 3B Meteo nor meteo.it publishes a feed any more."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si le preguntas por las noticias de hoy o el tiempo, puede descargar una de una lista fija de dos docenas de fuentes: ANSA (última hora, mundo, tecnología, política, cultura, deporte y tu región), la Repubblica, Corriere della Sera, Il Fatto Quotidiano, Il Sole 24 Ore, RaiNews, Tgcom24, AGI, La Gazzetta dello Sport, Wired, DDay, Focus, los avisos de MeteoAlarm para Italia, Hacker News, BBC News, The Guardian, The New York Times y NPR. Cada una se descargó con el nombre de esta aplicación en la petición antes de entrar en la lista. La previsión simple viene de open-meteo, porque ni 3B Meteo ni meteo.it publican ya un feed."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interrogé sur les nouvelles du jour ou la météo, il peut aller chercher l’un des flux d’une liste fixe de deux douzaines : ANSA (dépêches, monde, technologie, politique, culture, sport, et votre région), la Repubblica, Corriere della Sera, Il Fatto Quotidiano, Il Sole 24 Ore, RaiNews, Tgcom24, AGI, La Gazzetta dello Sport, Wired, DDay, Focus, les alertes MeteoAlarm pour l’Italie, Hacker News, BBC News, The Guardian, The New York Times et NPR. Chacun a été récupéré avec le nom de cette application dans la requête avant d’entrer dans la liste. Les prévisions simples viennent d’open-meteo, car ni 3B Meteo ni meteo.it ne publient plus de flux."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se gli chiedi le notizie di oggi o il tempo, può scaricare uno di un elenco fisso di due dozzine di feed: ANSA (ultima ora, mondo, tecnologia, politica, cultura, sport, e la tua regione), la Repubblica, Corriere della Sera, Il Fatto Quotidiano, Il Sole 24 Ore, RaiNews, Tgcom24, AGI, La Gazzetta dello Sport, Wired, DDay, Focus, le allerte MeteoAlarm per l'Italia, Hacker News, BBC News, The Guardian, The New York Times e NPR. Ognuno è stato scaricato col nome di questa applicazione nella richiesta prima di finire in elenco. Le previsioni semplici vengono da open-meteo, perché né 3B Meteo né meteo.it pubblicano più un feed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
