    "Curiosity comes with roaming whatever this switch says: every minute or two the cat comes over to the pointer, asks what you are writing, or goes to claw the edge of the screen. That part needs no engine and sends nothing anywhere." : {
      "comment" : "Curiosity comes with roaming whatever this switch says: every minute or two the cat comes over to the pointer, asks what you are writing, or goes to claw the edge of the screen. That part needs no engine and sends nothing anywhere.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Curiosity comes with roaming whatever this switch says: every minute or two the cat comes over to the pointer, asks what you are writing, or goes to claw the edge of the screen. That part needs no engine and sends nothing anywhere."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La curiosidad viene con el deambular, diga lo que diga este interruptor: cada uno o dos minutos el gato se acerca al cursor, pregunta qué estás escribiendo, o va a arañar el borde de la pantalla. Esa parte no usa ningún motor y no envía nada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La curiosité vient avec le vagabondage, quoi que dise cet interrupteur : toutes les une ou deux minutes le chat s’approche du curseur, demande ce que vous écrivez, ou va griffer le bord de l’écran. Cette partie n’utilise aucun moteur et n’envoie rien."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La curiosità arriva con il gironzolare qualunque cosa dica questo interruttore: ogni minuto o due il gatto si avvicina al puntatore, chiede cosa stai scrivendo, o va a graffiare il bordo dello schermo. Quella parte non usa nessun motore e non invia niente da nessuna parte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
