    },
    "It came over to ask what you are writing." : {
      "comment" : "It came over to ask what you are writing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It came over to ask what you are writing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vino a preguntar qué estás escribiendo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il est venu demander ce que vous écrivez."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "È venuto a chiedere cosa stai scrivendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can open an application, an address in a browser, one of your folders in the Finder, run one of your own Shortcuts, and copy or move a single file between your folders. That list is all of it. It always shows what it is about to do and waits for a yes; dismissing the bubble is a no. It never overwrites, never deletes, and never acts on text it read from the screen — only on what you said out loud." : {
      "comment" : "It can open an application, an address in a browser, one of your folders in the Finder, or one of your own Shortcuts — those four things and nothing else. It always shows you what it is about to do and waits for a yes; dismissing the bubble is a no. It will not move, copy or delete a file, and it never acts on text it read from the screen: only on what you said out loud.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It can open an application, an address in a browser, one of your folders in the Finder, run one of your own Shortcuts, and copy or move a single file between your folders. That list is all of it. It always shows what it is about to do and waits for a yes; dismissing the bubble is a no. It never overwrites, never deletes, and never acts on text it read from the screen — only on what you said out loud."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede abrir una aplicación, una dirección en el navegador, una de tus carpetas en el Finder, ejecutar uno de tus atajos, y copiar o mover un solo archivo entre tus carpetas. Esa lista es todo. Siempre enseña lo que va a hacer y espera un sí; cerrar el globo cuenta como no. Nunca sobrescribe, nunca borra, y nunca actúa sobre texto leído de la pantalla: solo sobre lo que dijiste."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il peut ouvrir une application, une adresse dans un navigateur, un de vos dossiers dans le Finder, exécuter un de vos raccourcis, et copier ou déplacer un seul fichier entre vos dossiers. Cette liste, c’est tout. Il montre toujours ce qu’il va faire et attend un oui ; fermer la bulle vaut non. Il n’écrase jamais, ne supprime jamais, et n’agit jamais sur du texte lu à l’écran : seulement sur ce que vous avez dit."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Può aprire un'applicazione, un indirizzo nel browser, una delle tue cartelle nel Finder, eseguire un tuo comando rapido, e copiare o spostare un singolo file fra le tue cartelle. Quella lista è tutto. Mostra sempre cosa sta per fare e aspetta un sì; chiudere il fumetto vale come no. Non sovrascrive mai, non cancella mai, e non agisce mai su testo letto dallo schermo: solo su quello che hai detto tu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It cannot name an address of its own — only one of those words — so nothing it reads can send it somewhere else. What comes back is quoted to it as somebody else's words, and an answer built on them is not allowed to open, copy or move anything: a headline is written by a stranger. The request carries no question, no account and no cookies; the site sees that a public feed was fetched. With Apple Intelligence or a model on this Mac the headlines stay here; with ChatGPT, Claude or a Shortcut they are sent on like any other question." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It cannot name an address of its own — only one of those words — so nothing it reads can send it somewhere else. What comes back is quoted to it as somebody else's words, and an answer built on them is not allowed to open, copy or move anything: a headline is written by a stranger. The request carries no question, no account and no cookies; the site sees that a public feed was fetched. With Apple Intelligence or a model on this Mac the headlines stay here; with ChatGPT, Claude or a Shortcut they are sent on like any other question."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No puede indicar una dirección propia —solo una de esas palabras—, así que nada de lo que lee puede mandarlo a otro sitio. Lo que vuelve se le cita como palabras de otros, y una respuesta construida sobre ellas no puede abrir, copiar ni mover nada: un titular lo escribe un desconocido. La petición no lleva la pregunta, ni cuenta ni cookies; el sitio ve que se descargó un feed público. Con Apple Intelligence o un modelo en este Mac los titulares se quedan aquí; con ChatGPT, Claude o un atajo se envían como cualquier otra pregunta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il ne peut pas indiquer une adresse à lui — seulement l’un de ces mots — donc rien de ce qu’il lit ne peut l’envoyer ailleurs. Ce qui revient lui est cité comme les mots de quelqu’un d’autre, et une réponse fondée là-dessus n’a pas le droit d’ouvrir, de copier ni de déplacer quoi que ce soit : un titre est écrit par un inconnu. La requête ne transporte ni question, ni compte, ni cookies ; le site voit qu’un flux public a été récupéré. Avec Apple Intelligence ou un modèle sur ce Mac, les titres restent ici ; avec ChatGPT, Claude ou un raccourci, ils sont envoyés comme n’importe quelle question."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non può indicare un indirizzo suo — solo una di quelle parole — quindi niente di quello che legge può mandarlo altrove. Quello che torna gli viene citato come parole di altri, e una risposta costruita su quelle non può aprire, copiare o spostare niente: un titolo lo scrive uno sconosciuto. La richiesta non porta la domanda, né account né cookie; il sito vede che è stato scaricato un feed pubblico. Con Apple Intelligence o un modello su questo Mac i titoli restano qui; con ChatGPT, Claude o un comando rapido vengono spediti come qualunque altra domanda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
