    "It is looking right now — what is in the field you are typing in, or under the pointer, is included above. It stops on its own, the time left is in the cat's menu, and one click there ends it. Password fields are refused, nothing at all is read while macOS has secure keyboard entry on, and only the last few hundred characters are taken." : {
      "comment" : "It is looking right now — what is in the field you are typing in, or under the pointer, is included above. It stops on its own, the time left is in the cat's menu, and one click there ends it. Password fields are refused, nothing at all is read while macOS has secure keyboard entry on, and only the last few hundred characters are taken.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It is looking right now — what is in the field you are typing in, or under the pointer, is included above. It stops on its own, the time left is in the cat's menu, and one click there ends it. Password fields are refused, nothing at all is read while macOS has secure keyboard entry on, and only the last few hundred characters are taken."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Está mirando ahora mismo — lo que hay en el campo donde escribes, o bajo el puntero, entra aquí arriba. Para solo, el tiempo que queda está en el menú del gato, y un clic ahí lo termina. Los campos de contraseña se rechazan, mientras macOS tiene la entrada segura activada no lee nada en absoluto, y solo se toman los últimos cientos de caracteres."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il regarde en ce moment — ce qui est dans le champ où vous écrivez, ou sous le pointeur, est inclus ci-dessus. Il s’arrête tout seul, le temps restant est dans le menu du chat, et un clic là-bas y met fin. Les champs de mot de passe sont refusés, rien n’est lu tant que macOS a la saisie sécurisée activée, et seuls les derniers quelques centaines de caractères sont pris."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sta guardando adesso — quello che c'è nel campo in cui stai scrivendo, o sotto il puntatore, entra qui sopra. Smette da solo, il tempo che manca è nel menu del gatto, e un click lì lo ferma. I campi password sono rifiutati, mentre macOS ha l'inserimento sicuro non legge assolutamente niente, e vengono presi solo gli ultimi qualche centinaio di caratteri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is not looking, and it has no Accessibility permission either, so it could not. The button above asks for both at once; the permission is in System Settings, Privacy & Security, Accessibility." : {
      "comment" : "It is not looking, and it has no Accessibility permission either, so it could not. The button above asks for both at once; the permission is in System Settings, Privacy & Security, Accessibility.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It is not looking, and it has no Accessibility permission either, so it could not. The button above asks for both at once; the permission is in System Settings, Privacy & Security, Accessibility."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No está mirando, y tampoco tiene el permiso de Accesibilidad, así que no podría. El botón de arriba pide los dos a la vez; el permiso está en Ajustes del Sistema, Privacidad y seguridad, Accesibilidad."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il ne regarde pas, et il n’a pas non plus la permission d’Accessibilité, donc il ne pourrait pas. Le bouton ci-dessus demande les deux à la fois ; la permission est dans Réglages Système, Confidentialité et sécurité, Accessibilité."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non sta guardando, e non ha nemmeno il permesso di Accessibilità, quindi non potrebbe. Il pulsante qui sopra chiede tutti e due insieme; il permesso è in Impostazioni di Sistema, Privacy e Sicurezza, Accessibilità."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is not looking. Ask it to — “guarda cosa sto facendo”, or the button above — and it reads the text you are working on for ten minutes and then stops by itself. There is no way to leave this on: a permission you have to remember to revoke is one nobody should have to remember." : {
      "comment" : "It is not looking. Ask it to — “guarda cosa sto facendo”, or the button above — and it reads the text you are working on for ten minutes and then stops by itself. There is no way to leave this on: a permission you have to remember to revoke is one nobody should have to remember.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It is not looking. Ask it to — “guarda cosa sto facendo”, or the button above — and it reads the text you are working on for ten minutes and then stops by itself. There is no way to leave this on: a permission you have to remember to revoke is one nobody should have to remember."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No está mirando. Pídeselo — «mira lo que estoy haciendo», o el botón de arriba — y lee el texto en el que trabajas durante diez minutos, y luego para solo. No hay manera de dejar esto encendido: un permiso que tienes que acordarte de revocar es un permiso que nadie debería tener que recordar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il ne regarde pas. Demandez-lui — « regarde ce que je fais », ou le bouton ci-dessus — et il lit le texte sur lequel vous travaillez pendant dix minutes, puis s’arrête de lui-même. Il n’y a aucun moyen de laisser ceci activé : une permission qu’il faut penser à révoquer est une permission dont personne ne devrait avoir à se souvenir."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non sta guardando. Chiediglielo — “guarda cosa sto facendo”, o il pulsante qui sopra — e legge il testo su cui stai lavorando per dieci minuti, poi smette da solo. Non c'è modo di lasciarlo acceso: un permesso che devi ricordarti di revocare è un permesso che nessuno dovrebbe doversi ricordare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is on the disk, and questions sent to it will come back empty. Choose a smaller one, or remove it to get the space back." : {
      "comment" : "It is on the disk, and questions sent to it will come back empty. Choose a smaller one, or remove it to get the space back.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It is on the disk, and questions sent to it will come back empty. Choose a smaller one, or remove it to get the space back."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Está en el disco, y las preguntas que se le envíen volverán vacías. Elige uno más pequeño, o quítalo para recuperar el espacio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il est sur le disque, et les questions qui lui sont envoyées reviendront vides. Choisissez-en un plus petit, ou supprimez-le pour récupérer la place."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "È sul disco, e le domande mandate a lui torneranno vuote. Scegline uno più piccolo, o rimuovilo per riprendere lo spazio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It knows it is in %@%@ — the name of the town and of the region, and nothing finer. No coordinates are kept, and it asks macOS again no oftener than once a day." : {
      "comment" : "It knows it is in %@%@ — the name of the town and of the region, and nothing finer. No coordinates are kept, and it asks macOS again no oftener than once a day.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It knows it is in %@%@ — the name of the town and of the region, and nothing finer. No coordinates are kept, and it asks macOS again no oftener than once a day."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sabe que está en %@%@ —el nombre del municipio y de la región, y nada más preciso—. No se guardan coordenadas, y se lo vuelve a preguntar a macOS como máximo una vez al día."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il sait qu’il est à %@%@ — le nom de la commune et de la région, et rien de plus précis. Aucune coordonnée n’est conservée, et il ne le redemande à macOS qu’une fois par jour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sa di essere a %@%@ — il nome del comune e della regione, e niente di più fine. Non vengono tenute coordinate, e lo richiede a macOS non più di una volta al giorno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It listens only while you hold the conversation, from the keystroke until you stop talking. Nothing is recorded and nothing is kept." : {
      "comment" : "It listens only while you hold the conversation, from the keystroke until you stop talking. Nothing is recorded and nothing is kept.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It listens only while you hold the conversation, from the keystroke until you stop talking. Nothing is recorded and nothing is kept."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escucha solo durante la conversación, desde el atajo hasta que dejas de hablar. Nada se graba y nada se guarda."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il n’écoute que pendant la conversation, du raccourci jusqu’à ce que vous vous taisiez. Rien n’est enregistré, rien n’est conservé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ascolta solo durante la conversazione, dalla scorciatoia fino a quando smetti di parlare. Niente viene registrato e niente viene conservato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It needs Neko %@ or newer, and this is %@." : {
      "comment" : "It needs Neko %@ or newer, and this is %@.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It needs Neko %@ or newer, and this is %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Necesita Neko %@ o posterior, y este es el %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il lui faut Neko %@ ou plus récent, et voici le %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ha bisogno di Neko %@ o più recente, e questo è il %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It pounced on the cursor." : {
      "comment" : "It pounced on the cursor.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It pounced on the cursor."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se lanzó sobre el cursor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il a bondi sur le curseur."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si è lanciato sul cursore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It processes text without naming a Shortcut to do it with." : {
      "comment" : "It processes text without naming a Shortcut to do it with.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It processes text without naming a Shortcut to do it with."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Procesa texto sin nombrar un atajo con el que hacerlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il traite du texte sans nommer un raccourci pour le faire."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elabora il testo senza nominare un comando rapido con cui farlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It remembers %lu day(s) and %lu line(s) worth keeping, %@ in plain text on this Mac. Older days are removed after thirty." : {
      "comment" : "It remembers %lu day(s) and %lu line(s) worth keeping, %@ in plain text on this Mac. Older days are removed after thirty.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It remembers %lu day(s) and %lu line(s) worth keeping, %@ in plain text on this Mac. Older days are removed after thirty."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recuerda %lu días y %lu líneas que merecen la pena, %@ en texto plano en este Mac. Los días más antiguos se eliminan tras treinta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il retient %lu jours et %lu lignes qui valent la peine, %@ en texte brut sur ce Mac. Les jours plus anciens sont supprimés après trente."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ricorda %lu giorni e %lu righe che vale la pena tenere, %@ in testo semplice su questo Mac. I giorni più vecchi vengono rimossi dopo trenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It remembers nothing yet. What it notices is written a day at a time, in plain text, on this Mac — never sent anywhere — kept for thirty days, and reduced each night to a few lines worth keeping." : {
      "comment" : "It remembers nothing yet. What it notices is written a day at a time, in plain text, on this Mac — never sent anywhere — kept for thirty days, and reduced each night to a few lines worth keeping.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It remembers nothing yet. What it notices is written a day at a time, in plain text, on this Mac — never sent anywhere — kept for thirty days, and reduced each night to a few lines worth keeping."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún no recuerda nada. Lo que nota se escribe día a día, en texto plano, en este Mac —nunca se envía a ninguna parte—, se guarda treinta días y cada noche se reduce a unas pocas líneas que merezcan la pena."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il ne retient encore rien. Ce qu’il remarque est écrit jour par jour, en texte brut, sur ce Mac — jamais envoyé ailleurs — conservé trente jours, et réduit chaque nuit à quelques lignes qui valent la peine."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non ricorda ancora niente. Quello che nota viene scritto un giorno alla volta, in testo semplice, su questo Mac — non viene mandato da nessuna parte — tenuto trenta giorni, e ogni notte ridotto a poche righe che valga la pena tenere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It said: %@" : {
      "comment" : "It said: %@",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
