    "Measured on this Mac: a 512 pixel picture at 14 steps took 14 seconds to draw, plus about nine to open the model the first time. More steps means a better picture and a longer wait. The model takes %@ of disk. " : {
      "comment" : "Measured on this Mac: a 512 pixel picture at 14 steps took 14 seconds to draw, plus about nine to open the model the first time. More steps means a better picture and a longer wait. The model takes %@ of disk. ",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Measured on this Mac: a 512 pixel picture at 14 steps took 14 seconds to draw, plus about nine to open the model the first time. More steps means a better picture and a longer wait. The model takes %@ of disk. "
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medido en este Mac: una imagen de 512 píxeles con 14 pasos tardó 14 segundos, más unos nueve para abrir el modelo la primera vez. Más pasos significa mejor imagen y más espera. El modelo ocupa %@ de disco. "
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mesuré sur ce Mac : une image de 512 pixels en 14 étapes a pris 14 secondes, plus une dizaine pour ouvrir le modèle la première fois. Plus d’étapes, meilleure image, attente plus longue. Le modèle occupe %@ de disque. "
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Misurato su questo Mac: un'immagine da 512 pixel a 14 passi ha richiesto 14 secondi, più una decina per aprire il modello la prima volta. Più passi vuol dire immagine migliore e attesa più lunga. Il modello occupa %@ di disco. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
