    "No engine is compiled into this build yet, so a downloaded model cannot answer. Everything around it is ready: the model can be fetched now and will be used the moment the engine lands." : {
      "comment" : "No engine is compiled into this build yet, so a downloaded model cannot answer. Everything around it is ready: the model can be fetched now and will be used the moment the engine lands.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No engine is compiled into this build yet, so a downloaded model cannot answer. Everything around it is ready: the model can be fetched now and will be used the moment the engine lands."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En esta versión todavía no hay ningún motor compilado, así que un modelo descargado no puede responder. Todo lo demás está listo: el modelo se puede descargar ya y se usará en cuanto llegue el motor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aucun moteur n’est encore compilé dans cette version, donc un modèle téléchargé ne peut pas répondre. Tout le reste est prêt : le modèle peut être récupéré maintenant et servira dès que le moteur arrivera."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In questa build non è ancora compilato alcun motore, quindi un modello scaricato non può rispondere. Tutto il resto è pronto: il modello si può scaricare adesso e verrà usato appena il motore arriva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No idea. I mostly chase the cursor." : {
