    "Nothing installed. A plugin is a folder whose name ends in .nekoplugin; add one and it arrives switched off." : {
      "comment" : "Nothing installed. A plugin is a folder whose name ends in .nekoplugin; add one and it arrives switched off.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing installed. A plugin is a folder whose name ends in .nekoplugin; add one and it arrives switched off."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No hay nada instalado. Un plugin es una carpeta cuyo nombre acaba en .nekoplugin; añade uno y llega apagado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rien d’installé. Un plugin est un dossier dont le nom se termine par .nekoplugin ; ajoutez-en un et il arrive éteint."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non c'è niente installato. Un plugin è una cartella il cui nome finisce in .nekoplugin; aggiungine uno e arriva spento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is read from inside your documents. Window titles are included only if this Mac has already granted Neko screen recording; the permission is never asked for. With Apple Intelligence or a model on this Mac, none of it leaves the Mac; with ChatGPT, Claude or a Shortcut, it is sent to that service like any other question." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing is read from inside your documents. Window titles are included only if this Mac has already granted Neko screen recording; the permission is never asked for. With Apple Intelligence or a model on this Mac, none of it leaves the Mac; with ChatGPT, Claude or a Shortcut, it is sent to that service like any other question."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se lee nada del interior de tus documentos. Los títulos de las ventanas se incluyen solo si este Mac ya le concedió a Neko la grabación de pantalla; el permiso nunca se pide. Con Apple Intelligence o un modelo en este Mac, nada sale del Mac; con ChatGPT, Claude o un atajo, se envía a ese servicio como cualquier otra pregunta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rien n’est lu à l’intérieur de vos documents. Les titres de fenêtres ne sont inclus que si ce Mac a déjà accordé à Neko l’enregistrement de l’écran ; l’autorisation n’est jamais demandée. Avec Apple Intelligence ou un modèle sur ce Mac, rien ne quitte le Mac ; avec ChatGPT, Claude ou un raccourci, c’est envoyé à ce service comme n’importe quelle question."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Niente viene letto dentro i tuoi documenti. I titoli delle finestre sono inclusi solo se questo Mac ha già concesso a Neko la registrazione dello schermo; il permesso non viene mai chiesto. Con Apple Intelligence o un modello su questo Mac non esce niente dal Mac; con ChatGPT, Claude o un comando rapido viene inviato a quel servizio come qualsiasi altra domanda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing on this Mac is up to writing remarks: Apple Intelligence is unavailable and no model of about two gigabytes or more is downloaded. The cat falls back to its own few written-in lines, and says less. Whatever engine is set for questions is untouched by this — it is only that a remark nobody asked for is not sent to a remote service." : {
      "comment" : "Nothing on this Mac is up to writing remarks: Apple Intelligence is unavailable and no model of about two gigabytes or more is downloaded. The cat falls back to its own few written-in lines, and says less. Whatever engine is set for questions is untouched by this — it is only that a remark nobody asked for is not sent to a remote service.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing on this Mac is up to writing remarks: Apple Intelligence is unavailable and no model of about two gigabytes or more is downloaded. The cat falls back to its own few written-in lines, and says less. Whatever engine is set for questions is untouched by this — it is only that a remark nobody asked for is not sent to a remote service."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En este Mac no hay nada capaz de escribir comentarios: Apple Intelligence no está disponible y no hay descargado ningún modelo de unos dos gigabytes o más. El gato vuelve a sus pocas frases ya escritas, y habla menos. El motor elegido para las preguntas no se toca: es solo que un comentario que nadie pidió no se manda a un servicio remoto."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rien sur ce Mac n’est à la hauteur pour écrire des remarques : Apple Intelligence est indisponible et aucun modèle d’environ deux gigaoctets ou plus n’est téléchargé. Le chat revient à ses quelques phrases écrites d’avance, et parle moins. Le moteur choisi pour les questions n’est pas concerné : c’est seulement qu’une remarque que personne n’a demandée n’est pas envoyée à un service distant."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su questo Mac non c'è niente in grado di scrivere commenti: Apple Intelligence non è disponibile e non è scaricato nessun modello da circa due gigabyte o più. Il gatto torna alle sue poche frasi già scritte, e parla meno. Il motore scelto per le domande non c'entra e non viene toccato: è solo che un commento che nessuno ha chiesto non viene mandato a un servizio remoto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
