    "Plugins live in Neko’s own folder in Application Support. Nothing here runs inside Neko, and nothing here can see your diary, your screen, your files or where you are — or make the cat speak on its own." : {
      "comment" : "Plugins live in Neko’s own folder in Application Support. Nothing here runs inside Neko, and nothing here can see your diary, your screen, your files or where you are — or make the cat speak on its own.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plugins live in Neko’s own folder in Application Support. Nothing here runs inside Neko, and nothing here can see your diary, your screen, your files or where you are — or make the cat speak on its own."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los plugins viven en la carpeta de Neko en Application Support. Nada de aquí se ejecuta dentro de Neko, y nada de aquí puede ver tu diario, tu pantalla, tus archivos ni dónde estás — ni hacer que el gato hable por su cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les plugins vivent dans le dossier de Neko dans Application Support. Rien ici ne s’exécute dans Neko, et rien ici ne peut voir votre journal, votre écran, vos fichiers ni où vous êtes — ni faire parler le chat de lui-même."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I plugin vivono nella cartella di Neko in Application Support. Niente qui gira dentro Neko, e niente qui può vedere il tuo diario, il tuo schermo, i tuoi file o dove ti trovi — né far parlare il gatto di sua iniziativa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
