    "Reading the text is on: what is in the field you are typing in, or under the pointer, is included above and goes wherever the rest of it goes. Password fields are refused, nothing at all is read while macOS has secure keyboard entry on, and only the last few hundred characters are taken." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reading the text is on: what is in the field you are typing in, or under the pointer, is included above and goes wherever the rest of it goes. Password fields are refused, nothing at all is read while macOS has secure keyboard entry on, and only the last few hundred characters are taken."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La lectura del texto está activada: lo que hay en el campo donde escribes, o bajo el puntero, aparece arriba y va a donde va todo lo demás. Los campos de contraseña se rechazan, no se lee nada mientras macOS tiene la entrada segura de teclado activa, y solo se toman los últimos cientos de caracteres."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La lecture du texte est activée : ce qui se trouve dans le champ où vous tapez, ou sous le pointeur, figure ci-dessus et part là où part le reste. Les champs de mot de passe sont refusés, rien n’est lu tant que macOS a la saisie sécurisée activée, et seules les dernières centaines de caractères sont prises."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La lettura del testo è attiva: quello che c’è nel campo in cui stai scrivendo, o sotto il puntatore, finisce qui sopra e va dove va tutto il resto. I campi password vengono rifiutati, non si legge niente mentre macOS ha l’inserimento sicuro da tastiera attivo, e vengono presi solo le ultime poche centinaia di caratteri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading the text is switched on but Neko has no Accessibility permission, so nothing is being read. Open System Settings, Privacy & Security, Accessibility, and allow Neko." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reading the text is switched on but Neko has no Accessibility permission, so nothing is being read. Open System Settings, Privacy & Security, Accessibility, and allow Neko."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La lectura del texto está activada pero Neko no tiene permiso de Accesibilidad, así que no lee nada. Abre Ajustes del Sistema, Privacidad y seguridad, Accesibilidad, y autoriza a Neko."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La lecture du texte est activée mais Neko n’a pas l’autorisation d’Accessibilité, donc rien n’est lu. Ouvrez Réglages Système, Confidentialité et sécurité, Accessibilité, et autorisez Neko."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La lettura del testo è accesa ma Neko non ha il permesso di Accessibilità, quindi non legge niente. Apri Impostazioni di Sistema, Privacy e sicurezza, Accessibilità, e autorizza Neko."
          }
        }
      }
    },
