    "Saying its name works too — which means the microphone stays open, the orange recording light stays on, and the battery notices. The listening is done on this Mac and the audio goes nowhere; it hears one word and forgets the rest." : {
      "comment" : "Saying its name works too — which means the microphone stays open, the orange recording light stays on, and the battery notices. The listening is done on this Mac and the audio goes nowhere; it hears one word and forgets the rest.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saying its name works too — which means the microphone stays open, the orange recording light stays on, and the battery notices. The listening is done on this Mac and the audio goes nowhere; it hears one word and forgets the rest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "También funciona diciendo su nombre, lo que significa micrófono siempre abierto, luz naranja encendida y batería que lo nota. La escucha ocurre en este Mac y el audio no va a ninguna parte: oye una palabra y olvida el resto."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dire son nom marche aussi — ce qui veut dire micro ouvert en permanence, voyant orange allumé, et batterie qui s’en aperçoit. L’écoute se fait sur ce Mac et l’audio ne part nulle part : il entend un mot et oublie le reste."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Funziona anche dicendo il suo nome — il che vuol dire microfono sempre aperto, pallino arancione sempre acceso, e la batteria se ne accorge. L'ascolto avviene su questo Mac e l'audio non va da nessuna parte: sente una parola e dimentica il resto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
