    "Seven programs in ten minutes: pick one and stay in it." : {
      "comment" : "suggestions while roaming",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seven programs in ten minutes: pick one and stay in it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Siete programas en diez minutos: elige uno y quédate."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sept programmes en dix minutes : choisis-en un et restes-y."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sette programmi in dieci minuti: scegline uno e restaci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shall I download the disk image%@? Installing it is yours to do: I open it and quit, and you drag Neko into Applications the way you did the first time." : {
      "comment" : "Shall I download the disk image%@? Installing it is yours to do: I open it and quit, and you drag Neko into Applications the way you did the first time.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shall I download the disk image%@? Installing it is yours to do: I open it and quit, and you drag Neko into Applications the way you did the first time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Descargo la imagen de disco%@? La instalación es tuya: yo la abro y me cierro, y arrastras Neko a Aplicaciones como la primera vez."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je télécharge l’image disque%@ ? L’installation est à toi : je l’ouvre et je me ferme, et tu fais glisser Neko dans Applications comme la première fois."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scarico l’immagine disco%@? L’installazione la fai tu: io la apro e mi chiudo, e trascini Neko dentro Applicazioni come la prima volta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shall I open it and quit? Then drag Neko into Applications, replacing the one that is there, and start it again. I close first so that the copy you are replacing is not the copy that is running." : {
      "comment" : "Shall I open it and quit? Then drag Neko into Applications, replacing the one that is there, and start it again. I close first so that the copy you are replacing is not the copy that is running.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shall I open it and quit? Then drag Neko into Applications, replacing the one that is there, and start it again. I close first so that the copy you are replacing is not the copy that is running."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿La abro y me cierro? Luego arrastra Neko a Aplicaciones, en lugar del que está, y vuelve a abrirlo. Me cierro primero para que la copia que sustituyes no sea la que está en marcha."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je l’ouvre et je me ferme ? Ensuite fais glisser Neko dans Applications, à la place de celui qui y est, et relance-le. Je me ferme d’abord pour que la copie que tu remplaces ne soit pas celle qui tourne."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La apro e mi chiudo? Poi trascina Neko dentro Applicazioni, al posto di quello che c’è, e riavvialo. Mi chiudo prima perché la copia che sostituisci non sia la copia in esecuzione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
