    "So that “alza il volume”, “metti in pausa” and “prossima canzone” reach Music and Spotify themselves. Those two applications and no others, with a fixed list of commands Neko sends. macOS asks once for each of them." : {
      "comment" : "So that “alza il volume”, “metti in pausa” and “prossima canzone” reach Music and Spotify themselves. Those two applications and no others, with a fixed list of commands Neko sends. macOS asks once for each of them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So that “alza il volume”, “metti in pausa” and “prossima canzone” reach Music and Spotify themselves. Those two applications and no others, with a fixed list of commands Neko sends. macOS asks once for each of them."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para que «alza il volume», «metti in pausa» y «prossima canzone» lleguen a Música y a Spotify directamente. Esas dos aplicaciones y ninguna otra, con una lista fija de comandos que Neko manda. macOS lo pregunta una vez por cada una."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour que « alza il volume », « metti in pausa » et « prossima canzone » aillent directement à Musique et à Spotify. Ces deux applications et aucune autre, avec une liste fixe de commandes que Neko envoie. macOS le demande une fois pour chacune."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Così “alza il volume”, “metti in pausa” e “prossima canzone” arrivano a Musica e a Spotify direttamente. Quelle due applicazioni e nessun’altra, con un elenco fisso di comandi che Neko manda. macOS lo chiede una volta per ciascuna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So that “what is the weather” and “what is happening here” need no city named. It keeps the name of the town and of the region, never the coordinates, and asks macOS for a position no oftener than once a day." : {
      "comment" : "So that “what is the weather” and “what is happening here” need no city named. It keeps the name of the town and of the region, never the coordinates, and asks macOS for a position no oftener than once a day.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So that “what is the weather” and “what is happening here” need no city named. It keeps the name of the town and of the region, never the coordinates, and asks macOS for a position no oftener than once a day."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para que “qué tiempo hace” y “qué pasa por aquí” no exijan nombrar una ciudad. Guarda el nombre del municipio y de la región, nunca las coordenadas, y pide una posición a macOS como máximo una vez al día."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour que « quel temps fait-il » et « que se passe-t-il ici » n’exigent pas de nommer une ville. Il garde le nom de la commune et de la région, jamais les coordonnées, et ne demande une position à macOS qu’une fois par jour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Così “che tempo fa” e “che notizie ci sono qui” non richiedono di dire la città. Tiene il nome del comune e della regione, mai le coordinate, e chiede a macOS una posizione non più di una volta al giorno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So this is where you work." : {
      "comment" : "So this is where you work.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
