    "This belongs to one behaviour only. Set Behaviour to “Roams on its own” in the Pet tab: a cat chasing the cursor has its attention elsewhere, and one living on the Dock is already busy." : {
      "comment" : "This belongs to one behaviour only. Set Behaviour to “Roams on its own” in the Pet tab: a cat chasing the cursor has its attention elsewhere, and one living on the Dock is already busy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This belongs to one behaviour only. Set Behaviour to “Roams on its own” in the Pet tab: a cat chasing the cursor has its attention elsewhere, and one living on the Dock is already busy."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto vive en un solo comportamiento. Pon Comportamiento en «Deambula por su cuenta» en la pestaña Mascota: un gato que persigue el cursor tiene la cabeza en otra parte, y el que vive en el Dock ya está ocupado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cela n’existe que dans un seul comportement. Choisissez « Vagabonde à sa guise » dans l’onglet Animal : un chat qui court après le curseur a la tête ailleurs, et celui qui vit sur le Dock est déjà occupé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa cosa vive in un solo comportamento. Imposta Comportamento su “Gironzola per conto suo” nella scheda Animale: un gatto che rincorre il cursore ha la testa altrove, e uno che vive sul Dock è già occupato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
