    "While roaming, Neko glances at what you are doing and now and then says something about it — a tip, a nudge, or a joke. It waits until you have been in one application for a while, keeps quiet when you are away from the keyboard, and says nothing at all when it has nothing worth saying." : {
      "comment" : "While roaming, Neko glances at what you are doing and now and then says something about it — a tip, a nudge, or a joke. It waits until you have been in one application for a while, keeps quiet when you are away from the keyboard, and says nothing at all when it has nothing worth saying.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While roaming, Neko glances at what you are doing and now and then says something about it — a tip, a nudge, or a joke. It waits until you have been in one application for a while, keeps quiet when you are away from the keyboard, and says nothing at all when it has nothing worth saying."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mientras deambula, Neko echa un vistazo a lo que haces y de vez en cuando dice algo: un consejo, un empujón o una broma. Espera a que lleves un rato en un programa, calla cuando no estás en el teclado, y no dice nada cuando no tiene nada que decir."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En vagabondant, Neko jette un œil à ce que vous faites et lâche de temps en temps une remarque — un conseil, un encouragement ou une blague. Il attend que vous soyez dans une application depuis un moment, se tait quand vous n’êtes pas au clavier, et ne dit rien du tout quand il n’a rien à dire."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mentre gironzola, Neko dà un’occhiata a quello che stai facendo e di tanto in tanto dice la sua — un consiglio, una spinta o una battuta. Aspetta che tu sia in un programma da un po’, tace quando non sei alla tastiera, e non dice niente quando non ha niente da dire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window titles are included only if this Mac has already granted Neko screen recording; that permission is never asked for. None of this ever leaves the Mac: what the cat notices is read by a model on this Mac or not at all, whichever engine you chose for answering questions." : {
      "comment" : "Window titles are included only if this Mac has already granted Neko screen recording; that permission is never asked for. None of this ever leaves the Mac: what the cat notices is read by a model on this Mac or not at all, whichever engine you chose for answering questions.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Window titles are included only if this Mac has already granted Neko screen recording; that permission is never asked for. None of this ever leaves the Mac: what the cat notices is read by a model on this Mac or not at all, whichever engine you chose for answering questions."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los títulos de las ventanas se incluyen solo si este Mac ya le ha concedido a Neko la grabación de pantalla; ese permiso no se pide nunca. Nada de esto sale del Mac: lo que el gato nota lo lee un modelo en este Mac o no lo lee nadie, sea cual sea el motor que elegiste para las preguntas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les titres des fenêtres ne sont inclus que si ce Mac a déjà accordé à Neko l’enregistrement de l’écran ; cette permission n’est jamais demandée. Rien de tout cela ne quitte le Mac : ce que le chat remarque est lu par un modèle sur ce Mac ou pas du tout, quel que soit le moteur choisi pour les questions."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I titoli delle finestre entrano solo se questo Mac ha già concesso a Neko la registrazione dello schermo; quel permesso non viene mai chiesto. Niente di tutto questo esce dal Mac: quello che il gatto nota lo legge un modello su questo Mac o non lo legge nessuno, qualunque motore tu abbia scelto per le domande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window titles are included only if this Mac has already granted Neko screen recording; that permission is never asked for. With Apple Intelligence or a model on this Mac, none of it leaves the Mac; with ChatGPT, Claude or a Shortcut, it is sent to that service like any other question." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Window titles are included only if this Mac has already granted Neko screen recording; that permission is never asked for. With Apple Intelligence or a model on this Mac, none of it leaves the Mac; with ChatGPT, Claude or a Shortcut, it is sent to that service like any other question."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los títulos de las ventanas se incluyen solo si este Mac ya le concedió a Neko la grabación de pantalla; ese permiso nunca se pide. Con Apple Intelligence o un modelo en este Mac, nada sale del Mac; con ChatGPT, Claude o un atajo, se envía a ese servicio como cualquier otra pregunta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les titres de fenêtres ne sont inclus que si ce Mac a déjà accordé à Neko l’enregistrement de l’écran ; cette autorisation n’est jamais demandée. Avec Apple Intelligence ou un modèle sur ce Mac, rien ne quitte le Mac ; avec ChatGPT, Claude ou un raccourci, c’est envoyé à ce service comme n’importe quelle question."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I titoli delle finestre sono inclusi solo se questo Mac ha già concesso a Neko la registrazione dello schermo; quel permesso non viene mai chiesto. Con Apple Intelligence o un modello su questo Mac non esce niente dal Mac; con ChatGPT, Claude o un comando rapido viene inviato a quel servizio come qualsiasi altra domanda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window titles, and nothing else. Neko never asks for this one: it is used if you granted it for some other reason, and simply left out if not." : {
      "comment" : "Window titles, and nothing else. Neko never asks for this one: it is used if you granted it for some other reason, and simply left out if not.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Window titles, and nothing else. Neko never asks for this one: it is used if you granted it for some other reason, and simply left out if not."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los títulos de las ventanas, nada más. Neko nunca lo pide: lo usa si lo concediste por otra cosa, y si no se apaña sin él."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les titres de fenêtres, rien d’autre. Neko ne la demande jamais : elle est utilisée si vous l’avez accordée pour autre chose, sinon on s’en passe."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo i titoli delle finestre. Neko non la chiede mai: la usa se l'hai concessa per altro, altrimenti fa senza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
